        "type": "string",
        "description": "Specific reservation lifecycle stage or outcome. PENDING is held or unreconciled; BOOKED is an established booking awaiting guest confirmation; CONTACTED and NO_ANSWER describe attempts to contact the guest; CONFIRMED means the guest has confirmed. ARRIVED includes partial arrival or seating. ORDER_PLACED includes meal courses. CHECK_DROPPED and CHECK_PAID describe the check. COMPLETE means service has finished. GUEST_CANCELLED and VENUE_CANCELLED identify cancellation attribution. NO_SHOW and NO_ENTRY describe unsuccessful attendance. An unrecognized lifecycle observation is classified as PENDING, BOOKED, or CONFIRMED from the available evidence.",
        "enum": [
          "PENDING",
          "BOOKED",
          "CONTACTED",
          "NO_ANSWER",
          "CONFIRMED",
          "ARRIVED",
          "GUEST_CANCELLED",
          "VENUE_CANCELLED",
          "NO_SHOW",
          "NO_ENTRY",
          "ORDER_PLACED",
          "CHECK_DROPPED",
          "CHECK_PAID",
          "COMPLETE"
        ]
      },
